      {
        "claim_id": "policy-reserve-interest",
        "claim_text": "Reserve-balance interest is the payment attached to reserve balances. The Board voted unanimously to set it at 3.90%, effective September 17. For a bank holding such balances, the relevant question is what those balances earn; this is distinct from the terms for obtaining or placing cash overnight.",
